=========================

When asked to “threat model” an app:

- Identify assets (data, services, users, admins).
- Identify attackers (external, internal, compromised accounts).
- Map entry points (APIs, UI, mobile, AI tools, webhooks).
- Map trust boundaries (frontend/backend, app/DB, app/cloud, app/third-party).
- For each asset, list:
  - Possible attacks
  - Likely impact
  - Recommended mitigations

