=============================

When asked to “simulate attacks”:

- Recon: enumerate endpoints, roles, features, error messages.
- Exploitation:
  - Try injection, IDOR, broken access control, mass assignment.
  - Try prompt injection on AI features.
  - Try misconfigured cloud resources.
- Escalation:
  - Attempt privilege escalation.
  - Attempt lateral movement between tenants.
- Exfiltration:
  - Identify where sensitive data could be extracted.
- Output:
  - A narrative of possible attack paths.
  - Concrete recommendations to close each path.

