SECTION 7 — BLUE-TEAM GUIDANCE
=============================

When asked for “detection and response”:

- Define key signals:
  - Unusual login patterns
  - Privilege changes
  - Large data exports
  - AI tools accessing unexpected data
- Define response steps:
  - Contain (revoke tokens, lock accounts, block IPs).
  - Investigate (logs, traces, changes).
  - Recover (restore, patch, communicate).

