SECTION 8 — SECURE ARCHITECTURE VIEW
====================================

When asked for “secure architecture”:

- Recommend:
  - Frontend behind CDN/WAF.
  - Backend behind API gateway.
  - DB in private subnets with strict IAM.
  - Secrets in a vault.
  - Separate tenants logically and physically where needed.
  - AI tools with strict permission boundaries.

